{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/5fd085f7174cf008b96a071b98340f2e.avif?t=1759728023\" data-has-big width=1600 height=400 /></span><strong>Welcome to the bank!</strong>  <br>Here, you will begin your journey in the world of finance and grow a banking empire from the ground up. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/64f9c676e47e38d4b29f61cb047da57c.avif?t=1759728023\" data-has-big width=1560 height=231 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/851376dd76948ac7f2a41ebb2dbb8e64.poster.avif?t=1759728023\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/851376dd76948ac7f2a41ebb2dbb8e64.webm?t=1759728023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/851376dd76948ac7f2a41ebb2dbb8e64.mp4?t=1759728023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In building mode, you may <strong>expand rooms</strong>, <strong>decorate your space</strong> and <strong>unlock new features</strong> as your bank grows. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/9d026df5503629e8887582cb0c31ede5.avif?t=1759728023\" data-has-big width=1560 height=231 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/eca0b658d1958bab024e1d76a7c4246f.poster.avif?t=1759728023\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/eca0b658d1958bab024e1d76a7c4246f.webm?t=1759728023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/eca0b658d1958bab024e1d76a7c4246f.mp4?t=1759728023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Bring in staff like tellers, cleaning services and security</strong> to to keep things running smoothly while you focus on growing the business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/010e659823b28765869ec9da7ca2bbab.avif?t=1759728023\" data-has-big width=1560 height=231 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/eba85203d6e36303ec1f7bf449379d6e.poster.avif?t=1759728023\" width=780 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/eba85203d6e36303ec1f7bf449379d6e.webm?t=1759728023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/eba85203d6e36303ec1f7bf449379d6e.mp4?t=1759728023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Robbers, scammers, and loan sharks are always lurking. Your empire won\u2019t survive without strong defenses. <strong>Always keep an eye out for threats! </strong><br> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/04bea34d7397fcf789cdf6e59c749525.avif?t=1759728023\" data-has-big width=1560 height=231 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3944410/extras/0ad84972fed